#: src/Audit/Auditor.php:282
msgid "Nothing to do unless one of them should be findable."
msgstr ""

#: src/Audit/Auditor.php:291
msgid "No XML sitemap is being served."
msgstr ""

#: src/Audit/Auditor.php:292
msgid "A sitemap is how a search engine finds pages that little else links to. Without one, discovery depends entirely on internal links."
